video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every game you obtain experiences depends on reached wave. Those experiences you can convert to abilities in a skill tree, that give you advantage for rest of game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills are passive (permament) and active, that you can choose during game in carddeck.  <br>If you have more skills and feel confident, you can choose harder chapter and earn more experience. Later in a game you can research speciality like support from sea, heroe`s special skill or chance to deal epic card that can change whole game. </p>",
        "short_description": "Rustic Defense is a fantasy tower defense game with roguelike elements, generated enviroment with option explore your own way. Research skills and heroes, choose path, build towers and upgrade them.",
        "supported_languages": "English",
        "reviews": "“Rustic Defense is a simplistic tower defense game but a very fun and very addicting one at that. The game could have used some more scenarios and different maps but it didn't take away from the fun I was having.”<br>8.5 – GAMING NEXUS<br><br>“Rustic Defense may not be a visual showcase, but its artistic direction is clearly built around clarity and readability, two elements that matter far more than spectacle in a strategy-focused game. The hex-based grid is clean, structured, and easy to read at a glance, while the fog of war effectively reinforces the feeling of uncertainty and gradual map discovery.”<br>9 – KEEN GAMER<br>",
